{"text": "Before long, Bernice had become one of the most popular girls at the club, and even Warren began to seek her out at every dance. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He listened to her stories eagerly, and he seemed to have forgotten the long devotion he had once shown to Marjorie herself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Marjorie had never truly wanted Warren, but now that her cousin was winning him away, she watched them together with growing, silent resentment. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was one thing to create a popular girl out of a dull cousin, but it was quite another to see that girl steal her own admirer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One afternoon, in front of a group of their friends, Marjorie remarked sweetly that Bernice had only been bluffing about cutting her hair. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Every eye turned to Bernice, and she realized with a sinking heart that if she refused now, all her new popularity would disappear at once. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So she rose to her feet and walked to the barbershop of the Sevier Hotel, followed by a curious, chattering crowd of her friends. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Walking with her head held high, she felt like Marie Antoinette on her way to the guillotine, determined not to show Marjorie her fear.", "alignment": {"characters": ["B", "e", "f", "o", "r", "e", " ", "l", "o", "n", "g", ",", " ", "B", "e", "r", "n", "i", "c", "e", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "b", "e", "c", "o", "m", "e", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "o", "s", "t", " ", "p", "o", "p", "u", "l", "a", "r", " ", "g", "i", "r", "l", "s", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "l", "u", "b", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", " ", "W", "a", "r", "r", "e", "n", " ", "b", "e", "g", "a", "n", " ", "t", "o", " ", "s", "e", "e", "k", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "o", "u", "t", " ", "a", "t", " ", "e", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "d", "a", "n", "c", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".